        "created_at": "2012-12-19T16:18:41.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Sentinels of the Multiverse will be one of a stack of games that will be featured in the Table Top room of the Anime Apocalypse Convention held on Dec 21st to the 23rd in Rockford, Il.</p>\n<div>My group the Regular Irregulars is the host for all the Table Top games and providing a large selection of board games to choose from.&nbsp;More info for interested parties can be found [url=http://animeapocalypse.org/]here[/url] and [url=https://www.facebook.com/pages/Anime-Apocalypse-Con/179854332056269?fref=ts]here[/url].</div>",
